  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "GE01110",
    "sub_id": "51900",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": "a. Midterm  30% \nb. Final  30% \nc. Quiz and homework  15% \nd. Attendance and Participation  25%",
    "course_pol": "請準時到達課堂 老師授課過程中請保持安靜 勿在堂上大聲交談或使用手機講電話 討論時間可以自由討論\n學期成績期中及期末考各佔30%  請務必參與考試 並用心準備好考試",
    "course_pol_en": "Demonstrate respect and consideration for the feelings of other students, unexpected noises and movements that automatically divert and attract attention such as d, sounds (music, speaking, tapping, etc.), exaggerated movements, etc.\n\n課堂規則\n請準時到達課堂 老師授課過程中請保持安靜 勿在堂上大聲交談或使用手機講電話 討論時間可以自由討論\n學期成績期中及期末考各佔30%  請務必參與考試 並用心準備好考試",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。\n<ul>\n\t<li>考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Learning must be based on honesty. Any student who attempts to use a work that he has not produced as his own is considered dishonest. Students who cheat or plagiarize in homework, tests or exams, or assist others, will be scored as zero. If they are repeat offenders, they will be submitted in accordance with the rewards and punishments for students of Feng Chia University.\n<ul>\n\t<li>It is considered cheating if you copy someone else&#39;s answers during an assessment, or if you turn in a paper or assignment that was written in whole or in part by someone else when you turned in an assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
